A||||2||Lurch||A few ECM/Engine Mgmt. questions||||1||
Z||000000||Lurch||05-01-2001||07:21 AM||||Trying to finish up the wiring on 88 coupe 5 spd/96 3100 engine swap.  Using 7727 ECM and harness to run 96 Grand prix 3100.  The 7727 has AUMX chip(90 Lumina 3.1, auto trans).<BR>Here are my questions:<P>1.  3100 has a 4 wire heated O2 sensor.  Should I use an earlier 1 wire sensor like on the Lumina, or would it be worth the effort to wire in the newer 4 wire sensor?<P>2.  EGR valve on 3100 appears to be some kind of stepper motor arrangement, unlike earlier V6-60 EGR. I don't believe the 7727 will drive this EGR. What are the fuel/inition advance implications of running with out the EGR?<P>3.  Is the fuel map for the 3.1 significantly different than that for the 3100?  Would I just be able to use a factory chip for the 7727 standard transmission option(fiero has a 5 spd)?<P>4.  Will the 4000 pulse/mile fiero vss signal drive 7727 ecm without problems?  Factory manual for lumina says std. trans. models have 24,000 pulse/mile VSS.  It appears, from the manual, That VSS signal is used mainly to set codes for egr, etc., but there is probably something I'm missing.<P>Thanks in advance for any information you  might share on these questions.||||reg||1
Z||000001||terryk||05-01-2001||11:44 AM||||Use the heated O2 if you have one. They heat faster and don't tend to cool off at idle. I doubt you'd have that problem anyway.<P>Linear EGR. I believe the 7727 wants a digital. It will complain and you will likely get part throttle pinging.<P>Odds are a manual trans Z-24 chip will work. Generally, the fueling will be the same, but the 96 came with an OBDII PCM and there's no telling what they did for emissions. Might even have used different size injectors. <P>The VSS: Are you using a Fiero VSS or the 96 Lumina VSS? If Lumina, it will be wrong. Only a DRAC or a change to the IP divisor and RSC in the mem-cal will fix that.<P>The VSS is for the speed limiter, decel fuel cutoff (shift anticipation), cooling fan shutoff.<p>[This message has been edited by terryk (edited 05-01-2001).]||||reg||1
Z||000002||Lurch||05-02-2001||06:42 AM||||Thanks terryk,<BR>A little clarification if you have time;<P>O2 sensor-I don't have wiring diagram for new engine, just 90 Lumina(7727 ecm) and fiero.  As I understand it the 4 wire sensor has a redundant signal ground.  Do you happen to know the pinout for this sensor?<P>Vss-Will the signal convertors that Dakota Digital sells drive the ecm? I'll use fiero vss(Isuzu 5 spd) 4000 pulse/mile, or does the buffered 2000 pulse/mile signal from the speedo need to be multiplied for use by the ecm?<P>Prom-When you suggest Z24 chip, do you mean for 3.1, manual trans, for that particular car model(Z24)? What is ID code for that chip?<P>Thanks for all the help terry-<BR>||||reg||1
